     ["शास्त्रीय वनस्पति विज्ञान", "जीवाश्म विज्ञान", "संख्या सिद्धांत गणित"],
     "Rapid innovation in IT and hardware leads to fast obsolescence, with papers losing peak relevance within a few years.",
